  "guidance": "Round numbers in a column to the nearest decimal point of your choosing.\n\n## Migrated examples\n#### Rounding a Column\n\n##### Recipe\n\n```yaml\nwrangles:\n  - round:\n      input: Cost Per Unit\n      output: Cost Rounded\n      decimals: 2\n```\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-grid\">\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-panel\">\n\n##### Input Sample\n\n| Cost Per Unit |\n| --- |\n| 3.14159 |\n| 2.71828 |\n\n</div>\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-panel\">\n\n##### Output Sample\n\n| Cost Per Unit | Cost Rounded |\n| --- | --- |\n| 3.14159 | 3.14 |\n| 2.71828 | 2.72 |\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
